# Monroe Book Narrator 1.2.5-CI

Use three loops: understand the book, make the words readable aloud, then direct/render/listen/improve. Keep the process lean; do not invent a ladder of chapter gates.

## Start the run

1. Read `/Users/drive/penname/pennamecodexv3/workflows/book-narrator-1.2.5.md` completely.
